      "description": "Central College - Student Big Red Student Life In order to use this site, it is necessary to enable JavaScript. Here are the instructions how to enable JavaScript in your web browser . All Jobs > Student Big Red Student Life Central College Apply Student Big Red Student Life PELLA, IA Apply Job Type Part-time Description Perform as \"Big Red\" mascot at Central and community appearances.? Remains in character while wearing the costume.? Represents Central's mission and core values in a positive friendly manner through performances at on and off campus events.? Maintains the proper use of Big Red costume as directed.? Interacts, in character, with Central students, faculty, staff, parents and families, children & alumni.? Works events throughout the year including evenings and weekends as applicable.? Distributes Central promotional items designed to create good will and increase school spirit.? Poses for photographs and communicates without speaking as directed.? Requirements Warm and engaging personality with a willingness to have fun? Professional demeanor? Independent and self-motivated with attention to detail? Ability to multi-task? Ability to work both individually and with a team? Must have good posture and physical ability to perform Big Red actions such as standing, running, kneeling, reaching, jumping, bending waving hands/arms, etc.? Apply View All Jobs Powered by Paylocity Privacy Policy | Payroll & HR Software Central College: Privacy Policy SMS Terms and Conditions and Privacy Policy"
